{"title":"Mathematics enrichment","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Mathematics enrichment</b> can take a variety of forms and appropriate math enrichment activities depend greatly on the age and development of an individual student.  This math enrichment guide is an editable guide to activities and programs for avid students of mathematics.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Math_Enrichment_Distance_Programs\">Math Enrichment Distance Programs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_enrichment&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Math Enrichment Distance Programs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Distance education provides parents, students, and teachers with options, allowing greater flexibility in planning education programs.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving\">Art of Problem Solving</a> hosts the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPSWiki\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPSWiki\">AoPSWiki</a> as well as many other resources for middle, high school, and college math students.  Many are availabe from the left sidebar.\n<ul><li>Books</li>\n<li>Online math classes</li>\n<li>Community</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talented_Youth\" title=\"Center for Talented Youth\">Center for Talented Youth</a> (CTY) at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Johns_Hopkins_University\" title=\"Johns Hopkins University\">Johns Hopkins University</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=EPGY\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"EPGY\">EPGY</a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Stanford_University&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Stanford University (page does not exist)\">Stanford University</a> program for gifted students.</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://netmath.uiuc.edu/\">Netmath</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OpenCourseWare\" title=\"OpenCourseWare\">OpenCourseWare</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIT\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MIT\">MIT</a> provides excellent material for high school students ready for a very rigorous self-study program.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Programs_in_the_U.K.\">Programs in the U.K.</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_enrichment&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Programs in the U.K.\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.nagty.ac.uk/\">National Academy for Gifted and Talented Youth</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources_for_Math_Students\">Resources for Math Students</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_enrichment&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Resources for Math Students\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_summer_programs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics summer programs\">Mathematics summer programs</a> (organized by elementary, middle, and high school programs)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_education_software&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mathematics education software (page does not exist)\">Mathematics education software</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_games&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Math games (page does not exist)\">Math games</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_scholarships\" title=\"Mathematics scholarships\">Mathematics scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">Mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gifted_education\" title=\"Gifted education\">Gifted education</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018094932\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 17/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1898:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018094932 and revision id 3750. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}